  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8a61f26d139ad642b9d16acefd3aa17, type: 3}
  m_Name: Log
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TM.Items.CombustibleData
  description: "A fallen titan of the forest, this massive log once belonged to a
    tree so old that its roots may have touched the memory of the world itself. Its
    bark is weathered and cracked like dried earth after a thousand summers, yet
    beneath the surface lies a stubborn strength that refuses to surrender to time.\n\nMoss
    clings to its surface in quiet devotion, and faint rings along its cut edge tell
    a story of centuries \u2014 of seasons endured, storms survived, and sunlight
    slowly gathered into its core. When you run your hand along it, you can feel
    the ghost of life still lingering inside, as if the wood has not fully accepted
    its own death.\n\nIt is heavy. Not just in weight, but in history."
  size: {x: 3, y: 2}
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f3deba02ac0b5f4f93f064c88f0278d, type: 3}
